# Hippiatrica Berolinensia - English translation, batch 19
# global indices 1170-1234 (65 items)
# Section: "On tetanus and opisthotonos" (Apsyrtus to Numenius; a long letter
# with extensive remedies) -> Hierocles' parallel account -> Theomnestus on
# the cause of tetanus, including Apsyrtus' famous first-person narrative of
# the Julian Alps snowstorm (soldiers and horses frozen while accompanying the
# emperor from Carnuntum toward Italy) and the "warmest remedy ever recorded"
# he devised from it -> Hippocrates -> anonymous remedies -> "Prognosis and
# cure of tetanus" / "of opisthotonos" -> Pelagonius' detailed clinical
# account and treatment.
#
